[['admin',['待办审批','approvals','quality','平台治理']],['company',['待办审批','approvals','quality','经营协同']],['factory',['验收审批','approvals','quality','采购执行']],['finance',['审批与对账','approvals','quality','资金管理']],['warehouse',['到站待办','approvals','quality','仓储作业']]].forEach(([k,item])=>{let arr=roleMenus[k];if(arr&&!arr.some(x=>x[1]==='approvals'))arr.push(item)});
const basePageContent=pageContent;pageContent=function(){if(page==='approvals')return approvalPage();return basePageContent()};
const baseRoleDashboard=roleDashboard;roleDashboard=function(){let html=baseRoleDashboard(),marker='<div class="notice blue">演示数据保存在当前浏览器 localStorage；同源标签页可同步，不是云端或跨设备同步。</div>';return html.includes(marker)?html.replace(marker,workflowWidget()+marker):html+workflowWidget()};
roleMobileHome=appendMobileWorkflow;

function handleEnterpriseAction(e){let el=e.target.closest('[data-action]');if(!el)return;let a=el.dataset.action,id=el.dataset.id,kind=el.dataset.kind;
  if(a==='order-create'&&roleKind()==='admin'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();enterpriseOrderModal();return}
  if(a==='order-contract'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();orderContract(id);return}
  if(a==='order-next'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();let o=findOrder(id);if(!o)return;switch(o.status){case'待报价':actOnWorkflow('order-confirm',id);break;case'待确认':actOnWorkflow('order-confirm',id);break;case'待发货':actOnWorkflow('dispatch',id);break;case'运输中':page='logistics';render();break;case'待验收':actOnWorkflow('receipt',id);break;case'待结算':if(settleAllowedOrder(id))settleOrder(id);break;default:toast('当前订单没有可推进的履约阶段','warn')}}
  if(a==='workflow-act'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();actOnWorkflow(kind,id);return}
  if(a==='workflow-return'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();workflowReturnModal(kind,id);return}
  if(a==='workflow-resubmit'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();let o=findOrder(id);if(o){o.reviewState='';o.reviewNote='';addOrderEvent(o,'补充资料并重新提交','业务负责人已补充资料，重新进入待复核队列。');save(`订单 ${id} 补充资料并重新提交`);render();toast('订单已重新提交复核')}return}
  if(a==='settle-one'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();if(settleAllowedOrder(id))settleOrder(id);return}
  if(a==='clear-filter'){enterpriseOrderStatus='全部状态'}
}
document.addEventListener('click',handleEnterpriseAction,true);
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target?.id==='order-status-filter'){enterpriseOrderStatus=e.target.value;render()}},true);
document.addEventListener('submit',e=>{
  let f=e.target.closest('form[data-form]');if(!f)return;
  if(f.dataset.form==='enterprise-order'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();createEnterpriseOrder(Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f).entries()));return}
  if(f.dataset.form==='enterprise-settings'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();let c=data.companies.find(x=>x.id===f.dataset.company);if(!c)return;let obj=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f).entries());c.name=obj.name;c.leader=obj.leader;c.enterprise={contactName:obj.contactName,contactPhone:obj.contactPhone,contactEmail:obj.contactEmail,taxNo:obj.taxNo,settlementCycle:obj.settlementCycle,creditLimit:Number(obj.creditLimit)||0,defaultWarehouse:obj.defaultWarehouse,qualityTolerance:obj.qualityTolerance,contractTemplate:obj.contractTemplate};save(`更新企业经营参数：${c.name}`);render();toast('企业经营参数已保存到本地演示数据');return}
  if(f.dataset.form==='workflow-return'){e.preventDefault();e.stopImmediatePropagation();let obj=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f).entries()),o=findOrder(obj.id);if(!o||!String(obj.note||'').trim()){toast('请填写需要补充的资料说明','warn');return}o.reviewState='退回补充';o.reviewNote=String(obj.note).trim();addWorkflowNote(obj.kind,obj.id,obj.note);addOrderEvent(o,'退回补充资料',obj.note);save(`订单 ${obj.id} 退回补充资料`);modal=null;render();toast('退回意见已记录；原始交易数据保留');return}
},true);

